            "max_check_attempts": 5,
            "notes": "Checks every disk of a Huawei OceanStor Pacific storage system via the REST API (/data_service/diskpool and /cluster/diskpool/queryNodeDiskInfo endpoints). Alerts when a disk is not healthy, and when its remaining life falls below the warning or critical threshold. Supports extended reporting via --lengthy.",
